---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure - IbadanSolarHub.com.ng"
  description="Learn about our affiliate relationships, advertising policies, and commitment to unbiased solar engineering recommendations."
>
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-12 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black">Affiliate Disclosure & Editorial Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 space-y-6">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>IbadanSolarHub.com.ng</strong>, our mission is to provide accurate, transparent, and actionable renewable energy information to homeowners, business managers, and technicians across Nigeria. We believe in complete transparency regarding how our platform is funded.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Affiliate Relationships</h2>
        <p>
          IbadanSolarHub.com.ng participates in various affiliate marketing programs designed to provide a means for websites to earn advertising fees by linking to retail partners. These include, but are not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Jumia KOL / Affiliate Program</strong> (Jumia Nigeria)</li>
          <li><strong>Konga Affiliate Program</strong></li>
          <li>Direct verified Nigerian solar distributor partner programs</li>
          <li>International equipment suppliers</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">
          When you click on links pointing to these retailers and complete a qualifying purchase, we may receive a small affiliate commission at <strong>absolutely zero additional cost to you</strong>. In fact, our negotiated partnerships frequently provide exclusive discounts for our community.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p>
          Our technical reviews, battery cycle comparisons, inverter sizing recommendations, and installer evaluations are based solely on engineering merit, durability under Nigerian environmental conditions, and real-world customer satisfaction. We do not accept payment to give artificially positive ratings to defective or counterfeit hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Display Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We may display banner advertisements served by third-party advertising networks (such as Google AdSense) or direct private sponsors. Sponsored placements are clearly marked with labels such as "Advertisement", "Sponsored", or "Partner Spotlight".
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or feedback regarding our affiliate relationships or disclosures, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@ibadansolarhub.com.ng" class="text-solar-600 font-bold hover:underline">info@ibadansolarhub.com.ng</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
